# [FEATURE REQUEST] (Shuttle) Mouse support

- Source URL: https://github.com/MiSTer-devel/Saturn_MiSTer/issues/146

Some users have asked on the Discord if it would be possible to support the Shuttle mouse (or even just a more basic mouse) on the core in the future.

---

## Pull Request

**PR Title:** Shuttle mouse support

**PR Number:** #249

**Status:** Merged

**Merged by:** srg320 on Sep 18, 2024

### Description

The pull request implements mouse support for Saturn games. Key features include:

- Maps USB mice to player 1/player 2 Saturn Shuttle mouse functionality
- Fixes joypad analog stick behavior when used as a mouse
- Enables input merging between USB mouse and joypad, allowing seamless switching during gameplay
- Maps left/middle/right USB mouse buttons to corresponding Shuttle Mouse buttons
- Routes additional USB mouse buttons (side buttons, etc.) to function as the 4th button/Start
- Scales joypad analog sensitivity to 37.5% to prevent oversensitivity

This addresses issue #146, a feature request for Shuttle Mouse support.

